  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved food and livelihood security in Bangladesh (CAFOD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is part of a programme in which four Bangladeshi partners are collaborating together in order to address food and livelihood insecurity, which were identified as the key problems in Bagerhat district.  CAFOD has appointed a Programme Co-ordinator based in Bangladesh to coordinate the reporting and monitoring, and ensure that the programme is well implemented in accordance with the programme documents and the contract with the European Commission.</narrative>
  </description>
